title: Authorizations › In progress › How a draft row's status and deadline are decided
route: /authorizations?view=progress
intro: A saved draft's row is worked out from how far the agents have got and from the kind of request. The status chip, the next-action line, the owner and the button follow the agents; the due pill follows the request type. All of it follows the demo clock, so Fast-forward turns 'Notice due in 5 h' into 'Overdue'.
dir: TD
also: The next-action cell shows the first sentence of the agent line. A red due pill puts the row in Act now, whatever else it says.
---
start s1 "A saved draft that is not a request yet is drawn as a row"
decision d1 "Is an agent waiting for an answer?"
process a1 "'Needs your input', button 'Answer'\nOwner: the agent who asked (Scribe, or Packet for a recertification)\nLine says what is needed"
decision d2 "Have all ten agents finished?"
process a2 "'Ready to sign', button 'Review and sign'\nOwner: Integrity\n'Integrity and Scrubber passed.'"
decision d3 "Has the run started?"
process a3 "'Agents working', button 'Watch' (outlined)\nOwner follows the next agent: Reader, Verify, Criteria, Historian, Placement, Forecaster, Scribe, Integrity, Packet, Scrubber\nLine, e.g. 'Packet is assembling the forms and attachments'"
process a5 "An agent could not finish: still 'Agents working'\nLine 'Verify could not reach Cardinal's portal.'\nIt counts in 'Needs attention'"
process a4 "'Intake not finished', button 'Continue'\nOwner: Reader\n'Intake is not finished.'"
process c1 "Chance\nStarts low and climbs while the first six agents finish, then holds\n'None' while intake is unfinished"

group gDue "Due pill by request type"
  decision d4 "What type of request?"
  process u1 "Admission: 'Notice due in 5 h'\nRed under 24 h, amber after"
  process u2 "Retro-authorization: 'Window closes in 18 h'\nRed under 24 h, amber after"
  process u3 "Recertification: 'Expires in 3 days'\nAmber under 4 days, grey after"
  process u4 "Continued stay: 'Review due 4:00 pm'\nA time when under a day, a weekday after. Amber"
  process u5 "Initial request: 'Packet due Thu'\nGrey"
  process u6 "Any clock that has passed: 'Overdue' in red"
  process u7 "No type or no clock yet: 'None'"
endgroup

process bd "Deadline band: a red pill is Act now\nOtherwise under a day Within 24 hours, under 7 days the week, else later"
end e1 "Row is drawn with its chip, line, owner, pill and button"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| a1
d1 -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| a2
d2 -->|No| d3
d3 -->|Yes| a3
d3 -->|No| a4
a3 -.-> a5
a1 & a2 & a3 & a4 --> c1
c1 --> d4
d4 -->|Admission| u1
d4 -->|Retro-authorization| u2
d4 -->|Recertification| u3
d4 -->|Continued stay| u4
d4 -->|Initial request| u5
d4 -->|Not set| u7
u1 & u2 & u3 & u4 & u5 -.-> u6
u1 & u2 & u3 & u4 & u5 & u6 & u7 --> bd
bd --> e1
